{"generated": "2026-08-19 19:32", "brief": "<b>1. 카카오모빌리티의 미국 IPO 추진</b>\n카카오모빌리티가 미국 증권거래위원회(SEC)에 비공개로 상장 서류를 제출하며 본격적인 미국 기업공개(IPO) 절차에 돌입했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiTkFVX3lxTE4zY1V3SVJiY0M4bFR6b2dLTnBDUnI2bVB4bmZJTDNiT1AwNXlZREdtQVNnZGVFVXlXZnlqR2R4T3RsaXFhZFZycjhaUkNrdw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#17</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTFA3VUp5UnpKcWdPcnZ1WGNlbGpxdkJNNTdtbENic05zOXlobzRTdU5fR1RzM0RjNGQ0X2Qwek1VWllpMXB4MU16RHlXc1prTlpSYkliT0dOVHN4UQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#24</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTFBKQW53Yk5kaWYtYml1T0tqRnNmWXJSRTBmcm5GVkkxT3cyRmJQd05vWnhyaWlENXF5eW9mWnpvaExNSGtNQURTdUREd3ZrN0d4b2oxQ1VR?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#32</a>]. 이는 국내 시장을 넘어 글로벌 무대에서 자금을 조달하고 기업가치를 극대화하기 위한 전략적 행보로 풀이됩니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTFBKQW53Yk5kaWYtYml1T0tqRnNmWXJSRTBmcm5GVkkxT3cyRmJQd05vWnhyaWlENXF5eW9mWnpvaExNSGtNQURTdUREd3ZrN0d4b2oxQ1VR?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#32</a>].\n\n<b>2. 롯데건설의 공모채 흥행과 투심 회복</b>\n롯데건설이 약 1년 만에 발행한 공모 회사채 수요예측에서 흥행을 기록하며 미매각 우려를 말끔히 씻어냈습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE82V1p4UEtkaXRJMmFTMDdRUUhsNWZIRWNrdHNsLVdBMUZMVUFlQnJoRkw3Zi16WUVrR1dOR1BzZE03RUdrdFE5bFBFY0N0Tk0?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#3</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNOTlieWR2VkVkdlJFWEk3c0dvTW1STTN1b2trMDVPYzFUVEVPcTFldFdtMVZXbHRaT1B6aUstd0lmNy1IdWw0V3BBczdnVXlzbExvakVnSFRwVE5WRFR5ZTdlSmdPdmFPRUxCdm04dUlqdHhtc183Wkg2VjY2cWhNT1FaaEgtS3dLVVFJ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#6</a>]. 최근 건설업계를 둘러싼 우려 속에서도 시장의 투자 심리가 회복세를 보이고 있음을 증명한 거래입니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNOTlieWR2VkVkdlJFWEk3c0dvTW1STTN1b2trMDVPYzFUVEVPcTFldFdtMVZXbHRaT1B6aUstd0lmNy1IdWw0V3BBczdnVXlzbExvakVnSFRwVE5WRFR5ZTdlSmdPdmFPRUxCdm04dUlqdHhtc183Wkg2VjY2cWhNT1FaaEgtS3dLVVFJ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\